    "body": "I understand that's what this sentence assumes but I don't see how such a condition is met given what's in https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-dispatch. It passes *parent* as the target of the struct in most cases and each get the parent relies on parent not being null. So I don't see how that's possible...",
